      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_admin_api_1abe4ad81cbe25e278d51ea3fc4fd2c366" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool themis::ingestion::IngestionAdminApi::retryQuarantineItem</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;item_path)</argsstring>
        <name>retryQuarantineItem</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::ingestion::IngestionAdminApi::retryQuarantineItem</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>item_path</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Retry a single quarantined item with exponential back-off. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Retry Quarantine Item.</para>
<para>When the entry has a <computeroutput>raw_payload</computeroutput>, the document is written directly without re-running the whole source. On each failed attempt the back-off delay is doubled (capped at <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_retry_config_1a986a17d8762431ea89dd1f9b2e412c91" kindref="member">RetryConfig::max_delay_ms</ref></computeroutput>). If <computeroutput>retry_count</computeroutput> reaches <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_retry_config_1a75e10491bdd831a4e8a2668f319c7e97" kindref="member">RetryConfig::max_quarantine_retries</ref></computeroutput> the entry is marked <computeroutput>permanently_failed</computeroutput> and excluded from future retries.</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>raw_payload</computeroutput> is empty (legacy entry) the method falls back to re-running the originating source from the last checkpoint.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>item_path</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The quarantined item path/URL </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if the item was successfully re-ingested and removed from quarantine; false if not found, permanently failed, or all retry attempts were exhausted</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">item_path</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Path to the item. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True when the operation succeeds.</para>
</simplesect>
Calls: getQuarantineItems(), std::find_if(), begin(), end(), getRetryConfig(), empty(), std::max(), getDocumentWriteFn(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="include/ingestion/ingestion_manager.h" line="2003" column="10" bodyfile="src/ingestion/ingestion_manager.cpp" bodystart="3025" bodyend="3106"/>
