    <briefdescription>
<para>Admin / Operator API for the ingestion module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an existing <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_manager" kindref="compound">IngestionManager</ref></computeroutput> and provides operator-level status, control, and quarantine management without requiring an HTTP server. An HTTP layer (e.g. crow, cpp-httplib) can expose these methods as REST endpoints (Q3 3.2 final step).</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">IngestionManager<sp/>mgr(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;db&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">mgr.registerSource({...});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_admin_api_1aea1ddb1ffac164735c346fadb9d34492" kindref="member">IngestionAdminApi</ref><sp/>admin(mgr);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>statuses<sp/>=<sp/>admin.listSources();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">admin.startSource(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;my_source&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
